{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-15","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量","englishTitle":"If two commensurable magnitudes be added together, the whole will also be commensurable with each of them; and, if the whole be commensurable with one of them, the original magnitudes will also be commensurable.","book":10,"number":15,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.15","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.15/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":15,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","contentId":"euclid-10-15","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b4fd5df2a259b88e9afb8afc4a7bb5182bd75dce22a3852c6e16e66e94d4ebb","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-15.statement","euclid-10-15.construction.1","euclid-10-15.proof.1","euclid-10-15.construction.2","euclid-10-15.proof.2","euclid-10-15.proof.3","euclid-10-15.proof.4","euclid-10-15.proof.5","euclid-10-15.construction.3","euclid-10-15.proof.6","euclid-10-15.proof.7","euclid-10-15.conclusion","euclid-10-15.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-15.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b705c2eabe4610b00a3b83ba7ae364492664e7307b70a6f439a3e2d3ad074b9e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two commensurable magnitudes be added together, the whole will also be commensurable with each of them; and, if the whole be commensurable with one of them, the original magnitudes will also be commensurable."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果将两个可公度级加在一起,则每个可公度级加在一起;如果一个可公度级加在一起,则原来的可公度级加在一起。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-15.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"612409abdb1ee767082f747eed0053f026ec3fa3eb84cc5d184c68075de7dd30","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two commensurable magnitudes AB, BC be added together; I say that the whole AC is also commensurable with each of the magnitudes AB, BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将两个可公度级的AB,BC加在一起;我说,整个AC级的每个级的AB,BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-15.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a2ce4c9d3497dec11c27bb4ae3fdb78b42e259d2106be9d37e5b7924ebc74f9a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AB, BC are commensurable, some magnitude will measure them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,AB,BC是可公度, 一定的量度它们。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-15.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e4023240b77729bcadebbe7b10254e433a09394011854e25aa091ba7eba06863","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it measure them, and let it be D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它测量它们,让它达到D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-15.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df60148ff789639f2586242dbd06a4c5db265cf951df5a2b1f6c01f1e3e6eac6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then D measures AB, BC, it will also measure the whole AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时起,还将对D项措施AB、BC项措施进行衡量。（相关点与线段：AC）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-15.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d2fc2e9af9f3df746727b82f16a3502ffc368019d58b85babea7ed25bfe98f43","citations":["euclid-10-def-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it measures AB, BC also; therefore D measures AB, BC, AC; therefore AC is commensurable with each of the magnitudes AB, BC. [[X. Def. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但它也测量了AB,BC;因此,D测量了AB,BC,AC;因此,AC测量了AB,BC,AB,每个尺寸为可公度,BC。 [[X. Def. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-15.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0c32768664d40b2584612eb9134d74f8ab99a87acb5a8109cbde4ec7e11cfa0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let AC be commensurable with AB; I say that AB, BC are also commensurable."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来,AC比可公度比AB;我说AB,BC也等于可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-15.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"57fd8ec757d13fb853b597f596ff08efab10e6a7a5ee0b17419838870ff40ad3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since AC, AB are commensurable, some magnitude will measure them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,AC,AB是可公度, 一定的量度它们。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-15.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e4023240b77729bcadebbe7b10254e433a09394011854e25aa091ba7eba06863","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it measure them, and let it be D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它测量它们,让它达到D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-15.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"525adbf857553842d37ed5a4eca813501090681fcf5c119c93f7714d20058811","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then D measures CA, AB, it will also measure the remainder BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"此后,还将对其余BC项措施进行衡量。（相关点与线段：CA、AB）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-15.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"58ef32a2c224918e40188bf48786dbe821e8809a6ece9e1d4d2121eb89b42948","citations":["euclid-10-def-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it measures AB also; therefore D will measure AB, BC; therefore AB, BC are commensurable. [[X. Def. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但该标准也为AB;因此,D将计量AB,BC;因此,AB,BC是可公度。 [[X. Def. 1](/principles/euclid-10-def-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-15.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-15.source","contentId":"euclid-10-15","revisionId":"euclid-10-15@raw-1b4fd5df2a259b88","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b25b4f10b4f1e26d9de0b16f2e9e6d799c1fcb6445f2ffe7bd201892714eb18","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.15/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.15\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-15:euclid-10-def-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-15","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-15.proof.3","euclid-10-15.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-def-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.15","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit